      "artifactText": "Inspection Findings:\nApproval Note for Plant Manager\nReport ID: IR-E201-2026-08-20 Equipment: E-201 Heat Exchanger\n\nInspection Findings:\nE-201 Heat Exchanger (IR-E201-2026-08-20):\nTube Wall Thickness: Rows 12-15 measured 3.8-4.2 mm (Minimum allowable tube wall thickness: 4.6 mm)\nLocalised Pitting Corrosion: At the shell inlet nozzle; maximum depth 1.8 mm\nAction Required: Recheck Weld Joint 4B\nE-202 Pressure Vessel (IR-E202-2026-08-21):\nTube Wall Thickness: Rows 12-15 measured 3.8-4.2 mm (Minimum allowable tube wall thickness: 4.6 mm)\nLocalised Pitting Corrosion: At the shell inlet nozzle; maximum depth 1.8 mm\nAction Required: Verify after repair\n\nRecommendations:\nE-201 Heat Exchanger (IR-E201-2026-08-20):\nRecommendation: Conditional clearance pending retubing of the affected tubes. (SOP-114 §3.2)\nE-202 Pressure Vessel (IR-E202-2026-08-21):\nRecommendation: Conditional clearance pending verification after repair. (SOP-114 §3.2)\n\nGrounding References:\nE-201 Heat Exchanger (IR-E201-2026-08-20): [SOP-114 §3.2]\nE-202 Pressure Vessel (IR-E202-2026-08-21): [SOP-114 §3.2]\n\nApproval Decision:\nE-201 Heat Exchanger (IR-E201-2026-08-20): Conditional clearance pending retubing of the affected tubes.\nE-202 Pressure Vessel (IR-E202-2026-08-21): Conditional clearance pending verification after repair.\n\nAction Items:\nE-201 Heat Exchanger (IR-E201-2026-08-20): Recheck Weld Joint 4B.\nE-202 Pressure Vessel (IR-E202-2026-08-21): Verify after repair.\n\nNote: The approval note must be reviewed and signed by the plant manager before returning the equipment to service.\nSource documents\ninspection-report-E201-annotated.pdf, page 1\ninspection-report-E201-annotated.pdf, page 2\ninspection-report-E202-followup.pdf, page 1\ninspection-report-E202-followup.pdf, page 2\n",
